<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON  Fedsure  YR EPS  122.4	  119.6-124     97.6</p>
<p>MON  Fedsure  YR DIV   87.0	  86.5-88.3     69.5</p>
<p>TUE  AECI     YR EPS  278.2	  277-280	 255</p>
<p>TUE  AECI     YR DIV   89.2	  85-92.5	 83</p>
<p>THU  Liberty  YR EPS   618	   598-637	 498.4</p>
<p>NOTE:- Liberty declared a final dividend of 180 cents on February 13, bringing its full payout for the year to 320 cents compared with a previous 256.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
